# SSD1680 controller tests

Exercises exact command/data transcripts, controller lifecycle, monochrome and
black/white/red RAM-plane handling, packed-region validation, full and
descriptor-qualified partial refresh, bounded busy timeout, transport failure,
and recovery against a recording MCU platform without physical hardware.
